              "question": "<p>Most drugs are metabolised using First order kinetics, meaning that in the first half life, half of the drug is excreted. Then, the timer starts again, and half of the remaining dose is excreted in the second half life. After 4.5 half lifes, about 5% of the drug remains.&nbsp;</p>\n"
